<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <%- include('../partials/head', { title: 'Reflections - Scriptorium' }) %>
    <style>

        .page-controls {
    display: flex; 
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between; 
    gap: 12px; 
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    padding-bottom: 1.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
}

.page-controls-left { 
    display: flex; 
    align-items: center; 
    gap: 20px; 
}

/* Ensure the button looks consistent */
.btn-back {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px;
    padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: 999px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
    font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 500; cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s;
    text-decoration: none;
    white-space: nowrap;
}
.btn-back:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); color:#fff; transform: translateX(-2px); }



/* Back Button styling for the top left */
.btn-back {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px;
    padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: 999px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
    font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 500; cursor: pointer;
    transition: background 0.2s, color 0.2s, transform 0.15s;
    text-decoration: none;
}
.btn-back:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); color:#fff; transform: translateX(-2px); }
.btn-back svg { width:14px; height:14px; flex-shrink:0; }
        /* Mood Selection Styles */
        .mood-btn.selected {
            background-color: #00C49A;
            color: #000;
            border-color: #00C49A;
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(0, 196, 154, 0.4);
        }
        
        /* Custom Scrollbar */
        .custom-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 6px; }
        .custom-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); }
        .custom-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #00C49A; border-radius: 4px; }

        /* Animation */
        @keyframes slideUp {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }
        .animate-slide-up { animation: slideUp 0.4s ease-out forwards; }

        /* Template Drawer */
        #templateDrawer {
            transform: translateX(100%);
            transition: transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
        }
        #templateDrawer.open {
            transform: translateX(0);
        }
        #templateOverlay {
            opacity: 0;
            pointer-events: none;
            transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
        }
        #templateOverlay.open {
            opacity: 1;
            pointer-events: all;
        }
        .template-card {
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        .template-card:hover {
            border-color: #00C49A;
            background: rgba(0,196,154,0.07);
            transform: translateY(-1px);
        }
        .template-card:hover .template-use-btn {
            opacity: 1;
        }
        .template-use-btn {
            opacity: 0;
            transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
        }
        @keyframes drawerSlideIn {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateX(12px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateX(0); }
        }
        .template-card-anim {
            opacity: 0;
            animation: drawerSlideIn 0.3s ease forwards;
        }
        .template-icon {
            width: 36px;
            height: 36px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 16px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        #templateBtn {
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }
        #templateBtn:hover {
            border-color: #00C49A;
            color: #00C49A;
            background: rgba(0,196,154,0.08);
        }
        #templateBtn.active {
            border-color: #00C49A;
            color: #00C49A;
            background: rgba(0,196,154,0.12);
        }
        @keyframes flashBorder {
            0%   { border-color: #00C49A; box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(0,196,154,0.3); }
            100% { border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); box-shadow: none; }
        }
        .fill-flash {
            animation: flashBorder 0.8s ease forwards;
        }

        /* ── Penguin tip ── */
        #penguinTip {
            position: fixed;
            bottom: 28px;
            left: 28px;
            z-index: 200;
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-end;
            gap: 12px;
        }
        #penguinTip.hidden { display: none; }
        #penguinBtn {
            width: 58px; height: 58px;
            border-radius: 50%; border: none;
            background: transparent; cursor: pointer;
            padding: 0; flex-shrink: 0;
            transition: transform 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.34,1.56,0.64,1);
            position: relative;
        }
        #penguinBtn:hover { transform: scale(1.12) rotate(-6deg); }
        #penguinBtn img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: contain; }
        #penguinBtn::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute; inset: -4px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            border: 2px solid rgba(0,196,154,0.45);
            animation: rPulse 2.2s ease-in-out infinite;
        }
        #penguinBtn.open::after { display: none; }
        @keyframes rPulse {
            0%,100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 0.5; }
            50%      { transform: scale(1.2); opacity: 0; }
        }
        #tipBubble {
            background: rgba(10,20,24,0.96);
            backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(0,196,154,0.2);
            border-radius: 18px;
            padding: 16px 18px 14px;
            max-width: 280px;
            width: calc(100vw - 110px);
            transform-origin: bottom left;
            animation: rBubblePop 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.34,1.56,0.64,1);
            box-shadow: 0 16px 48px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
        }
        #tipBubble.hidden { display: none; }
        @keyframes rBubblePop {
            from { transform: scale(0.85) translateY(10px); opacity: 0; }
            to   { transform: scale(1) translateY(0); opacity: 1; }
        }
        .tip-step { display: none; }
        .tip-step.active { display: block; }
        .tip-eyebrow {
            font-size: 0.57rem; font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase;
            color: #00C49A; margin-bottom: 5px;
        }
        .tip-title  { font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 800; color: #fff; margin: 0 0 5px; line-height: 1.25; }
        .tip-body   { font-size: 0.75rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.58); line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 12px; }
        .tip-footer { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 8px; }
        .tip-dots   { display: flex; gap: 5px; }
        .tip-dot    { width: 5px; height: 5px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.18); transition: background 0.2s; }
        .tip-dot.active { background: #00C49A; }
        .tip-btn-row { display: flex; gap: 7px; }
        .tip-btn    { padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; border: none; transition: all 0.18s; }
        .tip-btn-next { background: #00C49A; color: #000; }
        .tip-btn-next:hover { background: #33d4b0; }
        .tip-btn-skip { background: transparent; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.28); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); }
        .tip-btn-skip:hover { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55); }

        /* ── Medium screens: let grid grow naturally, no fixed viewport height ── */
        @media (max-width: 1024px) {
            .reflection-grid {
                height: auto !important;
            }
            .reflection-panel-left,
            .reflection-panel-right {
                height: auto !important;
                min-height: unset;
            }
            .reflection-panel-right {
                min-height: 300px;
            }
        }

        /* ── Mobile responsive ── */
        @media (max-width: 640px) {
            #penguinTip {
                bottom: 16px;
                left: 16px;
            }
            #tipBubble {
                max-width: calc(100vw - 100px);
            }
            #templateDrawer {
                width: 100%;
                max-width: 100%;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-[#2C1810] min-h-screen relative overflow-x-hidden overflow-y-auto font-outfit text-white">

    <%- include('../partials/navbar_app') %>

    <%# Ambient background blobs (decorative, pointer-events none) %>
<div class="absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden pointer-events-none z-0">
    <div class="absolute left-[10%] top-0 w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-scriptorium-gold rounded-full opacity-20 blur-[120px]"></div>
    <div class="absolute right-0 top-[40%] w-[600px] h-[600px] bg-scriptorium-gold-light rounded-full opacity-15 blur-[130px]"></div>
</div>
  
    <main class="relative z-10 container mx-auto px-4 py-8 max-w-6xl">

        <%- include('../partials/room_nav') %>
        
        <div class="page-controls">
            <div class="page-controls-left">
                <a href="/room" class="btn-back">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="width:14px; height:14px;">
                        <path d="M19 12H5M12 5l-7 7 7 7"/>
                    </svg>
                    Back to Room
                </a>

                <div style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:2px;">
                    <h1 class="text-3xl font-dancing text-white" style="margin:0; line-height:1;">Reflection Journal</h1>
                    <p class="text-white/40" style="font-size:0.75rem; margin:0;">Capture your thoughts on your journey</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-6 lg:gap-8" style="height: auto;">
            
            <div class="lg:col-span-7 bg-[#0f191e]/90 backdrop-blur-xl border border-[#00C49A]/30 rounded-3xl p-5 md:p-8 flex flex-col shadow-2xl relative animate-slide-up">
                
                <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-64 h-64 bg-[#00C49A] rounded-full opacity-5 blur-[100px] pointer-events-none"></div>

                <div class="mb-6">
                    <label class="block text-[#00C49A] text-sm font-bold mb-2 uppercase tracking-wider">Reflecting On</label>
                    <select id="itemSelect" class="w-full bg-black/40 border border-white/10 rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-white focus:border-[#00C49A] focus:outline-none transition-all appearance-none cursor-pointer">
                        <option value="" disabled selected>Select a book or track...</option>
                        </select>
                </div>

                <div class="mb-6">
                    <label class="block text-[#00C49A] text-sm font-bold mb-2 uppercase tracking-wider">Current Mood</label>
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3" id="moodContainer">
                        <button type="button" class="mood-btn px-4 py-2 rounded-full border border-white/10 hover:border-[#00C49A] transition-all text-sm flex items-center gap-2" data-mood="Happy">
                            <span>😊</span> Happy
                        </button>
                        <button type="button" class="mood-btn px-4 py-2 rounded-full border border-white/10 hover:border-[#00C49A] transition-all text-sm flex items-center gap-2" data-mood="Thoughtful">
                            <span>🤔</span> Thoughtful
                        </button>
                        <button type="button" class="mood-btn px-4 py-2 rounded-full border border-white/10 hover:border-[#00C49A] transition-all text-sm flex items-center gap-2" data-mood="Inspired">
                            <span>✨</span> Inspired
                        </button>
                        <button type="button" class="mood-btn px-4 py-2 rounded-full border border-white/10 hover:border-[#00C49A] transition-all text-sm flex items-center gap-2" data-mood="Confused">
                            <span>😵‍💫</span> Confused
                        </button>
                        <button type="button" class="mood-btn px-4 py-2 rounded-full border border-white/10 hover:border-[#00C49A] transition-all text-sm flex items-center gap-2" data-mood="Sad">
                            <span>😢</span> Sad
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="flex-grow mb-6 relative flex flex-col gap-2">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                        <label class="block text-[#00C49A] text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">Your Reflection</label>
                        <button id="templateBtn" class="flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg border border-white/10 text-white/50 text-xs font-semibold">
                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4 6h16M4 10h10M4 14h16M4 18h10"/>
                            </svg>
                            Templates
                        </button>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex-grow relative min-h-0">
                        <textarea id="reflectionText" class="w-full h-full bg-black/20 border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-4 text-white placeholder-white/30 focus:border-[#00C49A] focus:outline-none resize-none transition-all custom-scroll" style="min-height: 160px;" placeholder="Write your thoughts here... (Min 30 chars)"></textarea>
                        <div id="charCount" class="absolute bottom-3 right-4 text-xs text-white/30">0 chars</div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-start sm:items-center gap-3">
                    <div class="text-xs text-white/40">
                        <span id="editModeIndicator" class="hidden text-[#FFDA6D] font-bold">⚠️ Editing Mode</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex gap-3 w-full sm:w-auto">
                        <button id="cancelEditBtn" class="hidden px-6 py-2 rounded-full border border-white/10 text-white/60 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/5 transition-all text-sm font-bold">
                            Cancel
                        </button>
                        <button id="saveBtn" class="px-8 py-3 rounded-full bg-[#00C49A] text-black font-bold hover:bg-white hover:scale-105 transition-all shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(0,196,154,0.3)] w-full sm:w-auto">
                            Save Reflection
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="lg:col-span-5 bg-[#0f191e]/80 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/5 rounded-3xl p-5 md:p-6 flex flex-col animate-slide-up min-h-[300px]" style="animation-delay: 0.1s;">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-6 flex items-center gap-2">
                    <span class="text-[#00C49A]">📜</span> History
                </h3>

                <div id="loadingHistory" class="flex-grow flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-white/30">
                    <div class="w-8 h-8 border-2 border-[#00C49A] border-t-transparent rounded-full animate-spin mb-2"></div>
                    Loading...
                </div>

                <div id="historyList" class="flex-grow overflow-y-auto custom-scroll space-y-4 pr-2 hidden">
                    </div>
                <div id="historyFooter" class="mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-white/10 hidden">
                    <button
                        id="viewFullHistoryBtn"
                        class="w-full px-4 py-2 rounded-lg border border-white/10 text-white/70 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/5 transition-all text-sm"
                    >
                        View Full History →
                    </button>
                </div>
                <div id="emptyHistory" class="hidden flex-grow flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-white/30 text-center">
                    <p>No reflections yet.</p>
                    <p class="text-xs mt-1">Start writing to see them here.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </main>

    <div id="toast" class="fixed bottom-4 right-4 md:bottom-8 md:right-8 flex items-center gap-4 px-4 md:px-6 py-3 md:py-4 rounded-xl shadow-2xl transform translate-y-40 transition-transform duration-500 z-[100] border-l-4 max-w-[calc(100vw-2rem)]">
        <div id="toastIcon" class="text-2xl"></div>
        <div>
            <h4 id="toastTitle" class="font-bold text-lg"></h4>
            <p id="toastMessage" class="text-sm opacity-90"></p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Template Overlay -->
    <div id="templateOverlay" class="fixed inset-0 bg-black/60 backdrop-blur-sm z-40"></div>

    <!-- Template Drawer -->
    <div id="templateDrawer" class="fixed top-0 right-0 h-full w-full max-w-sm bg-[#0a1318] border-l border-white/10 z-50 flex flex-col shadow-2xl">
        
        <!-- Drawer Header -->
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between px-6 py-5 border-b border-white/10 shrink-0">
            <div>
                <h2 class="text-white font-bold text-lg leading-none">Reflection Templates</h2>
                <p class="text-white/40 text-xs mt-1">Pick one to get started — edit freely after</p>
            </div>
            <button id="closeTemplateDrawer" class="w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-white/10 text-white/40 hover:text-white hover:border-white/30 transition-all">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12"/>
                </svg>
            </button>
        </div>

        <!-- Template List -->
        <div id="templateList" class="flex-grow overflow-y-auto custom-scroll px-4 py-4 space-y-3">
            <!-- Injected by JS -->
        </div>

    </div>


    <!-- Penguin tip guide -->
    <div id="penguinTip" class="hidden">
        <button id="penguinBtn" title="How this works">
            <img src="/assets/penguin.gif" alt="Guide" />
        </button>
        <div id="tipBubble" class="hidden">

            <div class="tip-step active" data-step="0">
                <p class="tip-eyebrow">✦ Step 1 of 3</p>
                <p class="tip-title">Pick what you're reflecting on 📚</p>
                <p class="tip-body">Use the <strong style="color:#00C49A;">dropdown</strong> at the top to choose a book, film or track from your shelves. No item selected — no reflection saved.</p>
                <div class="tip-footer">
                    <div class="tip-dots"></div>
                    <div class="tip-btn-row">
                        <button class="tip-btn tip-btn-skip" id="tipSkip">Don't show again</button>
                        <button class="tip-btn tip-btn-next" id="tipNext">Next →</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="tip-step" data-step="1">
                <p class="tip-eyebrow">✦ Step 2 of 3</p>
                <p class="tip-title">Templates &amp; history ✍️</p>
                <p class="tip-body">Stuck on where to start? Hit <strong style="color:#00C49A;">Templates</strong> for guided prompts. The <strong style="color:#00C49A;">History panel</strong> on the right shows your past reflections — click any card to read it in full.</p>
                <div class="tip-footer">
                    <div class="tip-dots"></div>
                    <div class="tip-btn-row">
                        <button class="tip-btn tip-btn-skip" id="tipSkip">Don't show again</button>
                        <button class="tip-btn tip-btn-next" id="tipNext">Next →</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="tip-step" data-step="2">
                <p class="tip-eyebrow">✦ Step 3 of 3</p>
                <p class="tip-title">Earn yarns for every reflection 🧶</p>
                <p class="tip-body">Each reflection earns you <strong style="color:#ffd54f;">+10 yarns</strong>. Check your balance on the <strong style="color:#ffd54f;">Rewards</strong> page and spend them to unlock new avatars in <strong style="color:#ffd54f;">Customise</strong>.</p>
                <div class="tip-footer">
                    <div class="tip-dots"></div>
                    <div class="tip-btn-row">
                        <button class="tip-btn tip-btn-skip" id="tipSkip">Don't show again</button>
                        <button class="tip-btn tip-btn-next" id="tipNext">Got it! 🐧</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>

    <script src="/js/reflection.js"></script>

</body>
</html>